{"hymn":"S508","parent":"E1198","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Torrente poderoso es Dios","subtitle":"Experiencia de Dios—Su impartición","syl":{"n1":["To","i"],"n2":["rren","m"],"n3":["te","t"],"n4":["po","i"],"n6":["de","m"],"n7":["ro","m"],"n9":["so‿es","t"],"n10":"Dios,","n11":"Que","n12":["flu","i"],"n13":["ye","t"],"n14":["pa","i"],"n15":["ra","t"],"n16":["siem","i"],"n19":["pre;","t"],"n20":"Se","n21":["pro","i"],"n22":["ce","m"],"n23":["só","t"],"n25":["pa","i"],"n26":["ra‿al","m"],"n28":["can","m"],"n29":["zar","t"],"n30":"Al","n31":["hom","i"],"n32":["bre‿en","t"],"n33":"Su","n34":["co","i"],"n35":["rrien","m"],"n38":["te;","t"],"n39":"Mas","n40":["só","i"],"n41":["lo‿un","t"],"n42":"Dios","n43":"es","n44":"Él","n45":"Que","n46":["flu","i"],"n47":["ye‿a","t"],"n48":["nues","i"],"n49":["tro","t"],"n50":"ser;","n51":"Sus","n52":["pa","i"],"n53":["sos","t"],"n54":["cla","i"],"n55":["ves","t"],"n56":"son,","n57":"A","n58":"Su","n59":["im","i"],"n60":["par","m"],"n61":["ti","m"],"n62":["ción,","t"],"n63":"¡Y","n64":"hoy","n65":["flu","i"],"n66":["ye‿en","t"],"n67":["no","i"],"n68":["so","m"],"n71":["tros!","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["En el principio se ve a Dios","Como un río fluyente;","Conlleva el árbol dentro de él","Al mismo Dios viviente.","También en el final,","Fluyendo el río está","Con el Cordero-Dios,","Y el árbol que creció,","¡Dios fluye eternamente!"]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Fluyó en un hombre el mismo Dios,","El hombre Jesucristo.","La vida de Dios liberó","Con sumo sacrificio.","Aunque intentó Satán","Aquel fluir parar,","Crucificáronle,","Y cruel la lanza fue,","Mas salió agua y sangre."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["De Su costado así fluyó","Sangre para limpiarnos,","Y agua allí también brotó","Para regenerarnos.","Hoy el Espíritu","Nos brinda a Jesús;","Sólo logró el rival","Librar el manantial,","Y Dios sigue fluyendo."]}]}